only. The restricted risk set keeps clean pre-entry non-China-top years and qualifying\n2590:  treated years for treated countries. Treatment year is the first retained year of a qualifying China-top goods-export period.\n2591-\n2592-\n2593-\n2594-\n2595-                                                            63\n2596-\f8.10    Measurement Robustness: UNGA-DM Ideal Points\n2597-\n2598-The main estimations in the paper used the classic ideal-point measurement by BSV (Bai-\n2599-ley, Strezhnev, and Voeten 2017) as the response variable. However, according to Fjelstul,\n2600-Hug, and Kilby (2026), the set of resolutions included in the BSV dataset is not complete.\n2601-They provided a broader dataset, along with re-estimations of ideal points based on the\n2602-new data. To assess whether the results of the paper change with this new measurement,\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
